# Icons and screenshots ARE committed — including the Android launcher and
# splash densities below. The production build must not depend on Python and
# Pillow existing in the build container, aapt fails outright on a manifest
# that references a missing @mipmap/ic_launcher, and a web manifest pointing at
# icons that were never generated makes the PWA uninstallable.
# tools/gen-icons.py and packages/android/scripts/gen-android-assets.py remain
# the source of truth for regenerating them.

# Fetched by CI; see .github/workflows/android.yml
packages/android/android/gradle/wrapper/gradle-wrapper.jar

